@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant "adl-studio" as UI
participant "ADL Server\nGraphQL / REST / SSE" as API
participant "OwnerAccessResolver" as Resolver
participant "Owner Context" as Ctx
participant "Owner-scoped\nRepositories" as Repo

User -> UI : Select organization + enter API key
UI -> API : Request + X-Organization-Id + X-Api-Key
API -> Resolver : resolve(headers)
Resolver --> API : owner = telekom-demo
API -> Ctx : withOwner("telekom-demo")
API -> Repo : list()/get()/save()/delete()
Repo -> Ctx : currentOwner()
Repo --> API : only telekom-demo data
API --> UI : authorized response

User -> UI : Request without key for non-public org
UI -> API : Request + X-Organization-Id: telekom-demo
API -> Resolver : resolve(headers)
Resolver --> API : failure = 401 Missing organization API key
API --> UI : GraphQL auth error / REST-SSE 401

User -> UI : Request with invalid key
UI -> API : Request + X-Organization-Id + invalid X-Api-Key
API -> Resolver : resolve(headers)
Resolver --> API : failure = 403 Invalid or revoked organization API key
API --> UI : GraphQL auth error / REST-SSE 403
@enduml

